# The Vercel project root is this repository, but only the web application is
# needed for its configured ViralShorts-App root directory.
*
!ViralShorts-App
!ViralShorts-App/**

# Local dependencies, build output, Vercel metadata, and the native Tauri shell
# are never inputs to the hosted Vite build.
ViralShorts-App/node_modules
ViralShorts-App/dist
ViralShorts-App/.vercel
ViralShorts-App/src-tauri
